# reserve-temporal — a reservation with a DURATION and an on-elapse policy. `halt`
# (the safe default) denies on elapse; `proceed` (fail-open, opt-in) auto-acts. The
# language fixes the deadline and the elapse mode; the implementation runs the clock.
# NOTE: the engine PARSES duration/on_elapse but project() currently DROPS them — this
# vector requires extending the observation's reservation form to carry them (see the
# proposals README). The input below validates today; the expected.json is the target.
actor a
gate decide risk high grant a
reserve loans by legal duration 30d : halt
cord a -> decide
cord decide -> master
